<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sk">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Uhradená faktúra - platobný doklad</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a; background-color: #f8fafc;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;">Uhradená faktúra - platobný doklad</h1>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Ahoj,</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
      vďaka za platbu. Uhradenú faktúru nájdeš v prílohe.
    </p>

    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight: 600;">Suma</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #334155;"><%= amountFormatted %></p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem;">Ak máš otázky, odpovedz na tento e-mail.</p>

    <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem;">S pozdravom,<br>Michal Mihálik</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
